{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Pieces of the Past' is a cute, sentimental adventure where you restore family keepsakes to uncover touching stories. Blend puzzle-solving with the joy of preserving memories in this delightful journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786650/extras/5f17932a15329e7d1a2fb833a2002a6f.webp?t=1768810848\" width=400 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the life of Lily, a young adult gifted with the extraordinary ability of &quot;repairing memories.&quot; Fix broken items in this cozy, heartfelt puzzle adventure to uncover hidden family secrets. Explore themes of family, reconciliation, personal growth, and nostalgia in this captivating story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786650/extras/4581e07d84e9660e101240adad9e1929.poster.avif?t=1768810848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786650/extras/4581e07d84e9660e101240adad9e1929.webm?t=1768810848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786650/extras/e249c8dd1225e6dbea4993e1902d97e3.webp?t=1768810848\" width=575 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize Lily's unique skill to repair items and reveal the memories they hold. Each repaired item reveals a new piece of the family's history, offering insights into the motivations and experiences of each family member.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786650/extras/49ee47f0fa86da8b836287347bd0a87c.poster.avif?t=1768810848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786650/extras/49ee47f0fa86da8b836287347bd0a87c.webm?t=1768810848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786650/extras/b0ccabdcd01c898ae6d8764ff600abe6.webp?t=1768810848\" width=215 height=32 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory Repair Mechanic:</strong> Fix broken items to uncover the memories within and piece together your family's history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Storytelling:</strong> Dive deep into a narrative rich with themes of family, reconciliation, and personal growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Environments:</strong> Explore a beautifully crafted antique shop filled with historical and atmospheric details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-driven Experience:</strong> Witness Lily's journey of understanding and healing as she confronts the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay:</strong> Engage with a variety of items and puzzles to unlock new memories and advance the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786650/extras/421d8440d8faa4b2d48b58b6ce97d8aa.poster.avif?t=1768810848\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786650/e